The second administration of [[Zavier Bilal]] was formed on 1 December 2021, following his confirmation as [[Secretary General of Balisca]] by the [[Confederal Congress]] as a result of his victory in the [[2021 Baliscan premiership election]]. It succeeded the [[Bilal I Council|first Bilal government]] and is the incumbent [[Confederal government of Balisca|Government of Balisca]] since 1 December 2021, for a total of {{age in days|2021|12|1}} days.

